{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Download the EVAC BAY 09 Demo now to test your observation skills and step into the unsettling cycle.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075500/extras/949d3361fff6fc979cbaa08312272215.poster.avif?t=1759764353\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075500/extras/949d3361fff6fc979cbaa08312272215.webm?t=1759764353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075500/extras/949d3361fff6fc979cbaa08312272215.mp4?t=1759764353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEMO Gameplay\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are locked in a repeating loop within a deserted space station corridor. Your mission is simple: find the Evacuation Bay 09 to escape. Your only tools are your meticulous attention to detail and your wrist-mounted scanner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo features a taste of the full game experience, allowing you to discover and overcome a limited set of 20 distinct anomalies. Pay close attention to your <strong>surroundings</strong>, miss a change, and the loop resets. Every anomaly you find is a critical step closer to <strong>breaking the loop.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075500/extras/ae983ddda1e2ef248e21b8160a326620.poster.avif?t=1759764353\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075500/extras/ae983ddda1e2ef248e21b8160a326620.webm?t=1759764353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075500/extras/ae983ddda1e2ef248e21b8160a326620.mp4?t=1759764353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Snippet\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A catastrophic event has occurred, leaving you as the last crew member aboard the silent station. The path to freedom is just ahead, but the ship itself seems to be twisting your reality. This demo will introduce you to the start of the unsettling narrative as you begin to realize the corridor is not what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075500/extras/c05e2b385c6c68db7588b690618ffa65.poster.avif?t=1759764353\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075500/extras/c05e2b385c6c68db7588b690618ffa65.webm?t=1759764353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075500/extras/c05e2b385c6c68db7588b690618ffa65.mp4?t=1759764353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mechanics and Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip\u00a0your wrist-mounted scanner and begin your observation phase. In this demo, you will encounter impossible objects, subtle environmental shifts, and strange occurrences.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Anomalies:</strong> Test your wits against 20 unique anomalies pulled from the full game's expansive catalog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Glimpse of the End:</strong> Experience a taste of the full game's diverging narrative with 3 of the 6 total endings available to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Tension &amp; Psychological Pressure:</strong> The core loop of meticulous observation and high-stakes choices is fully present.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075500/extras/4656db057e47582df0ab270624eb2210.poster.avif?t=1759764353\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075500/extras/4656db057e47582df0ab270624eb2210.webm?t=1759764353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075500/extras/4656db057e47582df0ab270624eb2210.mp4?t=1759764353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you spot the strange anomalies and escape? Download the demo and see if you have the keen eye and quick wits to survive the first twists of the station's labyrinthine trap!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4075500?t=1759764353","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075500/ca71c7d902adf42dcb82a1c34825502c3c31472c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759764353","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075500/1206232c9e1b609e62e5aeb2592b93a24f8f7434/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759764353","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075500/1206232c9e1b609e62e5aeb2592b93a24f8f7434/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759764353","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Download the EVAC BAY 09 Demo now to test your observation skills and step into the